  - id: MLC_3tR
    en-US: LGF_DTLtoString_ISO
  - id: MLC_4ZE
    en-US: This function converts a date of data type DTL into a character string of data type STRING in international format (YYYY MM DD…).
  - id: MLC_4Jw
    en-US: Date to convert as DTL tag
  - id: MLC_48u
    en-US: Separator between the components of the output date.
  - id: MLC_Sh
    en-US: Temp string to setup the date string
  - id: MLC_4qz
    en-US: Temp iterator for replacing withspaces with '0' in nanosecondstring
