    en-US: Number of character positions for Year
  - id: MLC_4CD
    en-US: Number of character positions for Month, Day, Minute and Second
  - id: MLC_4wt
    en-US: Number of character positions for Nanoseconds
  - id: MLC_Pb
    en-US: Number of decimal places to convert
  - id: MLC_4VS
    en-US: Output format of the characters
  - id: MLC_3F5
    en-US: Character starting in string at which position the result is written.
  - id: MLC_4gF
    en-US: Character starting in string at which position the result is written.
  - id: MLC_48r
